Changes made in this edition (see git history for details):
- Private mode: every command and button is limited to OWNER and AUTHORIZED_USER
- Russian user interface: texts, progress bar, statuses, settings menu, error messages, command menu
- Quality setting and full titles for VK, OK.ru and other non-YouTube sites
- yt-dlp nightly with automatic daily updates inside the container
- Single-container setup: SQLite and in-memory cache instead of MySQL and Redis
- Removed upstream donation, deployment and Docker Hub publishing files
